{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24965","headline":"有感二首 二 · 牟融","name":"有感二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"搔首临风独倚栏，客边惊觉岁华残。\n栖迟未遇常鋾荐，邂逅宁弹贡禹冠。\n有兴不愁诗韵险，无聊只怕酒杯乾。\n何如日日长如醉，付与诗人一笑看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}